{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-diva","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"diva-reportage-properties-yas-island","about":"DIVA Residential Complex is located on Yas Island, one of the most popular destinations in Abu Dhabi. The project combines everything that the island itself is so famous for: luxury, entertainment, recreation areas and proximity to the sea. South of Yas, a stone's throw from Yas Bay Waterfront, are the Diva Towers, two luxury residential buildings with a unique contemporary design. They are located in a lively but quiet area with developed infrastructure. Here you will find 19 parks, 2 schools, 3 mosques and many shops. Settling in Diva, you will discover all the delights of island life and get a personal resort with access to the main roads of the city. AMAZING OPPORTUNITIES Yas South is the perfect place to live and invest. There is a multifunctional area Yas Bay, which claims to be the main coastal space in Abu Dhabi. It includes three separate blocks: Yas Bay Waterfront, Yas Bay Residences and Media Zone. Yas Bay Waterfront is an entertainment district that houses the Hilton hotel, cafes, restaurants, shops, a cinema, a beach club and the famous Etihad Arena. Not far from it you can find a modern residential complex Yas Bay Residences, where there is everything for a comfortable life on Yas Island: 19 parks, 2 schools, 3 mosques, many shops within walking distance.","price":930000,"title":"Diva","bitrix":{"id":845,"pf_id":"are.2.11233","source":null,"project_id":"Diva","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Diva","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Reportage Properties","project_location":"Yas Island"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/221/images/2023/6/9/340x252/6HeWgMC9Ie4DJPNnAY6GQe0YDh2lMD3Tky6dgJSC.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/221/images/2023/6/9/464x312/6HeWgMC9Ie4DJP